            <div xml:id="d451">

                <pb facs="0525" n="432" sameAs="frus:frus1935v04/pg432"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.2131/284: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Colombia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1935-01-24T09:00:00-05:00">January 24, 1935—9
                        a.m.</date><lb/>[Received 11:05 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>12. Your telegram No. 3, January 23, 6 p.m. Does my telegram No. 11, January 23,
                    6 p.m., affect the instruction that I see the Foreign <pb facs="0526" n="433"
                        xml:id="pg433"/> Minister? There appears to be no likelihood of an early
                    adjournment of Congress.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
